tasks.descriptionMarkdown:
Add `fast/verify.rs` (`describe_frame`, layer expansion hook) and `fast/tests/oracle_support.rs`:

- `OracleView` covering the OR-2 feature list;
- `Change` kinds;
- two-window lockstep with a forgetful reference;
- the glyph-box text system;
- first-difference reporting.

Write `fast/tests/oracle.rs`: mutation tests for the description, plus the randomized cached-view oracle with non-vacuity. Fix any defect it exposes in the current cached-view replay with its own focused test in the same group. Reference: gpui-fast `crates/gpui/src/fast/tests/oracle.rs`, `fast/layers/verify.rs`.

Add `tooling/testkit/src/fast_mode.rs`:

- parse Criterion and stats lines;
- render `fast-mode.md`;
- support `--compare`;
- add the `perf fast-mode` subcommand;
- add `fast_mode` to lane G's `BENCHES`.

Write `tooling/testkit/tests/fast_mode_report.rs` with recorded fixtures. Then run `gpux-testkit perf fast-mode` on the implementer's machine. Keep the run as `artifacts-temp/testkit/perf/baseline-s01/` and note the commit and machine for PERF-4.
